{"kind": "mod", "id": 1352, "name": "BotMonitor (CWX's Debugging Tool)", "slug": "botmonitor-cwxs-debugging-tool", "teaser": "Keep track of all your bot spawns during a raid with an in-game information overlay", "owner_name": "nooky", "downloads": 4268, "favourites": 0, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": null, "thumbnail_local": null, "category": null, "category_id": null, "updated_at": "2026-07-07T16:58:55.000000Z", "created_at": "2024-04-22T18:53:48.000000Z", "published_at": "2024-04-22T18:53:48.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~3.9.0", "latest_version": "2.4.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<p><strong>SPT 3.9.x ONLY</strong></p>\n<p><strong>ALL credit goes to CWX for creating this mod and DrakiaXYZ for updating it</strong></p>\n<p>This is a rebuild of <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1058-cwx-debuggingtool/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">CWX DEBUGGINGTOOL</a> for SPT 3.8.x</p>\n<p>Use this tool to keep track of bots in your raids.</p>\n<p><strong>How to install</strong></p>\n<p>- extract to your SPT folder</p>\n<p>- F12 for options or use console command ‘BotMonitor’</p>\n<p><strong>Console Commands</strong></p>\n<p>0: turns botmonitor off</p>\n<p>1: shows Total amount of bots</p>\n<p>2: 1 + Total Bots per Zone</p>\n<p>3: 2 + Each bot</p>\n<p>If you see this overlay on your screen then it’s working:</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/WSv8A7D.png\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WSv8A7D.png\" alt=\"WSv8A7D.png\" /></a></p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "2.4.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.9.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1824, "published_at": "2024-07-21T20:33:39.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-